erybody and that is more, you know, has been -- it was going on before the tariff situation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/28/semtech-corp-smtc-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SMTC 2020 Q3","e":"smtc","d":"2019-12-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mohan R. Maheswaran","x":"But fundamentally, the thinking is that, there are plenty of WiFi boxes already established out there and WiFi usually is being used for higher bandwidth Internet connectivity and video streaming and those types of things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/05/semtech-corp-smtc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SMTC 2020 Q3","e":"smtc","d":"2019-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mohan R. Maheswaran","x":"The uncertainties are still around the kind of macro environment, the trade war stuff and China-related stuff and the Huawei ban-related stuff, but outside those, I don't see there's any major reason to be concerned about the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/05/semtech-corp-smtc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SMTC 2020 Q3","e":"smtc","d":"2019-12-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emeka N. Chukwu","x":"Q3 GAAP operating expense decreased 8% sequentially, due to lower performance-based compensation expense and the non-recurrence of restructuring charges that occurred in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/05/semtech-corp-smtc-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SMTC 2020 Q4","e":"smtc","d":"2020-03-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Emeka Chukwu","x":"Fiscal year '20 net sales decreased 13% over the prior year driven by the challenging microenvironment the overall industry faced for most of the year fueled by the China tariffs and the Huawei ban.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/11/semtech-corp-smtc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SMTC 2020 Q4","e":"smtc","d":"2020-03-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mohan Maheswaran","x":"We have the pipeline and LoRa remember many of the use cases are really energy efficiency, productivity enhancements, cost reduction kind of approaches and even smart health kind of segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/11/semtech-corp-smtc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SMTC 2020 Q4","e":"smtc","d":"2020-03-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emeka Chukwu","x":"No, no, it has mostly to do with an actuarial valuation of our defined benefit obligations and a few other things, but there was no restructuring in terms of letting people go and stuff like that during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/11/semtech-corp-smtc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"SMTC 2021 Q4","e":"smtc","d":"2021-03-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Emeka Chukwu","x":"We expect that any increase is due to the global supply chain constraints should be mitigated by slower customer pricing reductions or in some cases price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/17/semtech-corp-smtc-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2021 Q4","e":"smtc","d":"2021-03-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mohan Maheswaran","x":"On the cost side we are going out and deliberately looking specifically at where we can also offset that with raising prices, in some cases, I think it's also being more disciplined about how we work with our partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/17/semtech-corp-smtc-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2022 Q1","e":"smtc","d":"2021-06-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Emeka Chukwu","x":"We believe that we can continue to mitigate the higher costs associated with the challenging global supply chain through slower customer pricing reductions or through price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/06/03/semtech-corp-smtc-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2022 Q1","e":"smtc","d":"2021-06-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Gerra","x":"How much of that is driven by mix and presumably data center versus price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/06/03/semtech-corp-smtc-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2022 Q2","e":"smtc","d":"2021-09-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Emeka Chukwu","x":"The one headwind that we have, what I think we have managed it very well so far is all of these supply constraints we have right now and the fact that is driving a whole lot of price increases in terms of wafer pricing and the back end pricing as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/02/semtech-corporation-smtc-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"SMTC 2022 Q2","e":"smtc","d":"2021-09-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Emeka Chukwu","x":"And I think, I would like to answer it by saying that so far this year we've actually received price increases from some of our foundry partners and back end partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/02/semtech-corporation-smtc-q1-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"SMTC 2022 Q3","e":"smtc","d":"2021-12-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mohan Maheswaran","x":"But I think most of our price increases have been really driven by increases in our supply chain costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/02/semtech-corporation-smtc-q3-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"SMTC 2022 Q3","e":"smtc","d":"2021-12-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mohan Maheswaran","x":"So we have focused very much on when we've had an increase in wafer costs or specifically cost for a specific product, whether it be fab or assembly and test-related trying to pass that on to our customer base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/02/semtech-corporation-smtc-q3-2022-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"SMTC 2026 Q2","e":"smtc","d":"2025-08-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hong Hou","x":"We all read the same news and earnings report the CSPs, they have strong conviction and forecast to increase the CapEx spending to expand the data center capacity and upgrade for the AI capability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/25/semtech-smtc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2026 Q2","e":"smtc","d":"2025-08-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hong Hou","x":"We believe when the 1.6 transceivers are launched, and very next thing, you know, there will be first driving for volume and then later on driving for cost reduction and the power reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/25/semtech-smtc-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2026 Q3","e":"smtc","d":"2025-11-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hong Hou","x":"And the new TIA and driver building blocks that establish new performance standards for 1.6 multimode optical transceivers in AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/24/semtech-smtc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2026 Q3","e":"smtc","d":"2025-11-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hong Hou","x":"This conviction is supported by our expectation of continued increases in AI CapEx, expanding customer engagement, and a strong demand pipeline for high-performance, low-power solutions, including the incremental contributions from linear pluggable optics or LPO and the coverage linear equalizers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/24/semtech-smtc-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2026 Q4","e":"smtc","d":"2026-03-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hong Q. Hou","x":"Power efficiency has become one of the defining constraints of the modern AI infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/16/semtech-smtc-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2026 Q4","e":"smtc","d":"2026-03-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hong Q. Hou","x":"The AI data center buildout is one of the most significant infrastructure investments in a generation, and we believe Semtech is well positioned with a broad, purpose-built portfolio of solutions designed for 1.6T and 3.2T era.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/16/semtech-smtc-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2027 Q1","e":"smtc","d":"2026-05-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Hong Q. Hou","x":"So we have got a very healthy pipeline of new products and broaden our portfolio serving the high bandwidth, AI data center connectivity space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/26/semtech-smtc-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SMTC 2027 Q1","e":"smtc","d":"2026-05-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Hong Q. Hou","x":"So I guess from your position today, you know, based on the outlook kind of that you provided on the call, to what degree do you feel that raised guide is coming from potential market share gains?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/26/semtech-smtc-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,6687,0,0,0,4870,1382],[35,1,6551,0,0,0,5416,687],[36,1,7298,0,0,0,5889,1044],[37,1,9525,0,0,0,6833,2210],[38,1,9919,0,0,0,7125,2281],[39,1,8346,0,0,0,6266,1585],[40,1,9136,0,0,0,6998,574],[41,1,11577,0,0,0,8568,2462],[42,1,10050,0,0,0,7207,2357],[43,1,10759,0,0,0,8114,2146],[44,1,10196,0,0,0,8228,1532],[45,1,9531,0,0,0,7271,1837],[46,1,8618,0,0,0,6351,1823],[47,1,8262,0,0,0,6172,1701],[62,1,8113,0,0,0,6189,1198],[63,1,7958,0,0,0,5881,1653],[64,1,7615,0,0,0,5895,1204],[65,1,8126,0,0,0,6779,437],[66,1,8254,0,0,0,5783,2138]],"cinema":[[34,1,6687,0,0,0,4870,1382],[35,1,6551,0,0,0,5416,687],[36,1,7298,0,0,0,5889,1044],[37,1,9525,0,0,0,6833,2210],[38,1,9919,0,0,0,7125,2281],